  "source": {
    "short": "Pareja, Arte de la lengua timuquana (1614)",
    "full": "Francisco Pareja, Arte de la lengua timuquana, written in 1614, published from the single original copy by Lucien Adam and Julien Vinson (Paris: Maisonneuve, 1886; Bibliothèque linguistique américaine, XI). Mati Mati spelling."
